  "details": "If you have multiple objects connected to a root bone with the phys script on it, you cannot hold more than one at a time. you can move them with colliders just fine, but cannot grab 2 at a time.\nIt would be nice if you were able to grab more than one. As is it seems a little limiting. Since in many cases it would be so much simpler to have a single root for when you want multiple items to have the same physbone makeup.",
